[{"id":"26025","date":"2026-11-03T12:18:50+00:00","text":"🚨 REPORT: Charles Leclerc’s contract could be preventing Ferrari from introducing written rules of engagement. F1 business journalist Marc Limacher claims to have heard that Leclerc has held a preferential clause covering sporting and technical matters in his Ferrari contract since 2020. According to Limacher, the clause could prevent Ferrari from establishing written rules of engagement between its drivers. The claim comes amid renewed tensions between Lewis Hamilton and Leclerc following their clash in Mexico. Ferrari has not confirmed the existence of such a clause. (via. MarcLimacher) #F1","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/tQ3wnA-YBi_WPjctKZfYF6Ow5h0oZTQheJLa8m9H4qMzyL3oC-lnl1UG8eHM3cioRpsK0OLaGBd-oY39jvpXhDlT-adxd9BmoKfGSz89B73_877FDx1Arsw4Ls8nOU8qdyA8pMi1svT3CPy7_zL0OIthD3PxMcJKba1igQanzv8w4RNsWyq3nURLffkAIU6KHgqUxYN6LVE_A-_UneWAZbttNialwN8RI6bHAUpAoYF8Z973nWinMGCVe7QLrru2XB8u9rhJqauuXlx4K7LgyoozKZM7mSKd7vxRUnG4vPmc2INNdts8oBW535-o90s748iGLikYKa5K8ZpqKnPiHA.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"26024","date":"2026-11-03T11:14:01+00:00","text":"🚨 FORECAST FOR BRAZIL FP1 - 25% chance of rain, 24ºC FP2 - 20% chance of rain, 22ºC FP3 - 40% chance of rain, 28ºC Qualy - 90% chance of rain, 25ºC Race - 50% chance of rain, 15ºC Temperatures will drop by MORE THAN 10 DEGREES from Saturday to Sunday","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/oPJ1C8nDyyCuPE8NxMHKiZiuPSiWu1nPLlnqD3huFoMfkhqdLLfHXb8fqxk_Ooa7HwDvTBoNlKdm0A-zF7KBsoOGUvDOCWngyJnrsFH9bNsXgepOShKLe7ivShub1DwXULAj8uig8-eUIQ79OaHUhWRuxv7-7TKk3zsDCfXZImniBWRs1TRgWhnVhQHa5bNuu7Sgccig3fC86CqLP0f2lqJvZ-t9kmrsFdNGUTITuRGgg70LHuwUM6Xfir1MXttojGmpLtB591cS5l-CToTwaIkRpFEnoVX7Iwwv3Mrvs3i-onwZToqByhqKDkcaWMDehe2MPwU9EnN4vjcw7dbDxA.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"26023","date":"2026-11-03T11:02:01+00:00","text":"Kimi Antonelli's name will be forever etched among the all-time greats ✍️ #F1 #BrazilGP 🇧🇷","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/EwBLvYD80awqJQc