[{"id":"26032","date":"2026-11-04T21:05:22+00:00","text":"Nico Rosberg reveals the extreme lengths he went to in order to beat Lewis Hamilton to the 2016 F1 World Championship. 🏎️ Removed the paint from his helmet to save 80 grams. 🚴 Stopped cycling to lose 600 grams of leg muscle. 🧠 Spent two hours every other day on mental training. 🤐 Refused to even say the word “championship” in interviews to avoid putting pressure on himself. Rosberg says every kilogram was worth roughly 0.03 seconds per lap. At Suzuka, he took pole ahead of Hamilton by just 0.02 seconds. “My superpower was preparation. Because natural talent, Lewis is the GOAT and the greatest, so I’m not going to beat him with natural talent.” (via. F1 Beyond the Grid) #F1","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/UFmn2RxIMoj0bLMZ157tZQL8fgvTR7Kigt1uJEEN9eKr7sytLqEhaN-wN5D7p_dJvqiUfNKFfknwlKMGvZFTXEgMpKPexQOdQhFCYUTqCcitgC0gkbYAfURtTsXK4h3mUkvWU4tRR6Ez37sqoObK8pDlRm_IVib9bkI1OTXUr1qWIBAaLAfJeCRR2YPwFdQ2Q1lGUKzQoY-FzN_SQTCqADpOCYSUB9MoBfD1_v9vS_69dO7KT1CHM-cqW_xqowqJZrhV5b3paKkRGgFcVfRSW4T3hdylMG2lfvxxVyqzWov5ElI7UeAaOaX4HylDaE7uCPs9BEfbg6cgRewNOYTp4Q.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"26031","date":"2026-11-04T15:35:48+00:00","text":"🚨 | NEW: Alpine reveal special race suits for the Brazilian GP.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/E1DKXKR2004zBG08Ao7ccZL9dqDUgYu18NmU91HRrDWYg7KsCiawOeOS3WUSGAZblhpFVwXau5pIludY9zNU5YjvKFAaJl1p6TaVj5eZlsA8h6dHkqBlQAyg1i_SxDCUt-rNGzouJRlY0A5q7pq_blbA8HntH4cFoU2BZrVZ1TYysdPXwtWT6ubR-OMYYkN1MksisKB_Jj1G2N_FKD1M4LtG9A0awiQ_5zT_hsWDYT8EioNDo0JJxvZXhQdox-ZUz8BESd7DztPaxxMFdbRbicn39k0HXyLpFjWhjyRogD4GQpW3rmbJ5v1-XqDmahYGpUKmDkW0eT-QgO4cCxuyxw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"26030","date":"2026-11-04T14:17:02+00:00","text":"The last two drivers to become F1 World Champions with the number 12 🇧🇷 🤝 🇮🇹","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/COTN7gNXdWiF8urftc3SdUNIRtuV2cSw9VKdkikb2nUe502RTv_6TintgHxsOwISYI3T3jq2WzlNayWwl2evtZDdaB7LLAeDhYaVvqvTcxL5cVeMg8_NHVRaCwbzT9HCxJOmC2